WEBVTT

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:52.050
Memorial for dogs

00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:01.460
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:11.770
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:28.280
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:35.360
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:41.600
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:49.640
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:54.110
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:58.250
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:01.420
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:07.090
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:11.490
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:14.560
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:21.370
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:27.010
The Machos Are Licking!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.020
Keita.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:34.520
Look.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:37.390
"Physical contact with your dog is important."

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:39.590
"Trimming and nail clipping, of course,"

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:42.290
"but please regularly play with them."

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:43.460
So it says.

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:44.290
So?

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.930
So please do it with me too.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:49.500
The physical contact part.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.900
But that's for dogs.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.540
And I'm an Inukami.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.500
They're totally different.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:03:00.780
Come on Keita, play with me, please?

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.180
I have to look for part time jobs.

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:07.950
It's tough because someone eats a lot when there's no Inukami User jobs.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:15.860
Come on, I'll massage your stiff parts and make it feel good.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:18.260
My stiff parts?

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:22.570
This isn't the time. Get off.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:26.840
Oh, is that so?
Then I'll just play with you.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:32.340
Whoa, what's with that erotic smile?

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:36.850
It's the much-awaited naked time.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.380
Telep...

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:45.820
No, it's a dog!
Don't come here!

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:48.820
You sure are weird.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.790
An Inukami afraid of dogs?

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:55.130
I can't help it.
Scary things are scary.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.670
Help me, Keita.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.270
Let me think about it.

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.980
How about forgiving her now?

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:22.990
It has been a while,
Master Keita and Yoko.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.230
Hake.

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.860
Long time no see, what's up?

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:31.000
My master is calling the two of you.
Please come with me.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.740
Huh?

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.000
Grandma is?

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:45.350
Here, Grandma.
Souvenirs from the city.

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:49.320
As usual, you're a very rough person.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:50.790
You don't want it?

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:54.620
No, I mean, I am the head of the Kawahira family.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:57.860
Surely you can show a little bit of respect.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.230
What, you called me all this way just to lecture me?

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.600
Oh well, it's good enough that you're healthy.

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.740
Are you getting along with Yoko?

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:11.770
We get along great every day.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.580
It would've been easier with an Inukami like Hake.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:18.550
Then shall we form a contract?

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.820
Don't say something you don't mean.

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:24.290
By the way, Keita.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.960
I have a job for you.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.640
That won't work.

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:41.200
It'll break right away.

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.910
What are you doing? Hey.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:44.440
Bring more here.

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:50.750
Seems pretty noisy around here.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.780
Is a typhoon coming?

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:56.250
An urgent request for Inukami Users?

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.720
It's from an old friend of mine,

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:01.960
the chief priest of a temple called Daidouji.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.460
A possessing spirit.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.590
But why Inukami Users?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:10.930
I called him for more details but he's panicked and couldn't explain.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:14.070
So either he's really busy, or...

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:16.040
He's hiding something.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:17.410
Is this a dangerous job?

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:19.140
Yeah.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.180
What should we do, Keita?

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:25.980
Let's just go.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.990
I doubt it's for a festival.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:35.590
It feels like they're unusually angry.

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:42.430
Old lady, is something happening?

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:45.000
Did you two come here for sightseeing?

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.800
No.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.600
We're going to Daidouji...

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:52.340
What?

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:57.150
Are you related to that temple?

00:06:57.150 --> 00:07:01.250
Related? We were just called by them.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:03.450
Called by them?

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:10.060
Don't you dare come back, cursed fools!

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:11.730
Go home!

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:15.100
Keita, what's up with her?

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.470
I don't even know.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.740
But there's definitely something happening at Daidouji.

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:25.010
Nuisance

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.010
Cursed

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.560
What's wrong? Is something there?

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.530
I don't know, but...

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.540
On our way here,

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:57.810
we mentioned the name
Daidouji and got attacked.

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:00.580
Seems like you're pretty despised.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:03.480
I really needed a walk.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:07.520
But I have done terrible things to the neighbors.

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:17.560
Chief Priest.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.100
I'm sorry.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:28.570
If I told you the truth, I'm sure you would run away and leave me too.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.040
So you've contacted other psychics?

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:35.080
Four people, one of them is hospitalized.

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:39.820
Thankfully he survived, but some had their hair turn grey overnight.

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:42.420
Chief Priest, please talk to us.

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:44.120
I will not run away.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.120
And besides...

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:50.430
There's no way
I would leave Grandma's friend.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:56.770
I understand,
I will tell you everything.

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:59.070
Actually...

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:03.370
No, Andreanov.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:13.520
Andreanov, bad dog.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:17.490
Oh, does that girl hate dogs?

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.990
No, that's not the problem.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:26.400
For generations, we have held memorials for dogs in this temple.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:30.500
With the recent trend for pets, it became pretty popular.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.130
- Hey.
- So anyway.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.200
A member of a university karate club from the city,

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:40.080
of all things, destroyed the enshrined memorial rocks for the dogs.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.480
- Hey.
- And so.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:44.710
A dog's spirit couldn't rest in peace,

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:48.450
and it possessed that person.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:49.820
More importantly.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:52.390
Do something about him.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.360
I didn't realize.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.830
Andreanov, come here.

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:03.100
I understand the situation now.

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:05.200
I will thoroughly exorcise him.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:07.800
Wait, no.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.910
No, Inukami User.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:13.280
I want Andreanov to properly rest in peace.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.280
Right, so I'll send him to heaven.

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.180
No, you're wrong.

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:21.450
This dog is a good boy.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.120
He just never had a good owner,

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.120
and no one loved him.

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:28.960
He has many regrets in this world.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:31.290
That's why he possessed this man.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:34.230
He was an innocent and pure puppy.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.030
He's just a puppy?

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.470
Wait, to make him rest in peace...

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:40.700
Indeed.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:43.710
Dogs need physical contact with their owners.

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:45.510
I'm going home.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.910
Please wait, Inukami User.

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:52.180
Would you please listen to this old man's request?

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:56.820
I don't have the slightest interest to pat a macho man in his underwear!

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:02.690
It seems everybody woke up.

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:03.660
Everybody?

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:08.800
This man, Andreanov, is the leader of a college karate club.

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:11.970
He brought other members for mountain climbing.

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:13.740
Other members?

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:16.670
Coincidentally, there were 20 members,

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.710
and there were 20 dogs enshrined.

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:21.840
The numbers fit perfectly.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.280
"Inukami!"

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.690
Woof woof.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:34.790
"Inukami!"

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.320
Woof woof.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:41.800
Help me!

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:45.730
Yoko, wake up!

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:47.770
Use your Teleport!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.380
No!

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:56.750
Teleport.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:00.550
What the heck?

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.460
You're amazing.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:16.160
A true Inukami User of the main family.

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:21.600
Are you making fun of me?

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:23.110
No, you're wrong.

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:25.110
See, look at them.

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:30.850
Huh, why am I here?

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:32.850
The spirits have rested in peace.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:37.520
You've done what I and other psychics couldn't do.

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.590
You have fulfilled their desires.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:42.460
Dogs?

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.530
I see.

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:52.230
They are dogs.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.740
I was just playing around with dogs.

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.640
Dogs, just dogs.

00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:59.710
That's right, they're dogs.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.540
Inukami User?

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:05.550
That's right, if it's just dogs, maybe...

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:08.280
That's right, I have to do it.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.320
Enemy attack.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:13.490
Enemy attack!

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:15.120
They're coming.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:18.190
I'm not going to let them do as they please.

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:23.930
Slow down!

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:25.170
We're going to crash!

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:34.880
Sorry about that!

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:39.920
Come on!

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.420
Stop it!

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:45.090
Hey, wait up!

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:46.350
Hey!

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:52.260
Darn, we lost again.

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:56.600
I can't take it anymore.
It's an all out war now!

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:02.500
Thank you for walking them.

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:07.240
I totally see why you're despised by the people now.

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:11.210
Having them run around the city is huge trouble.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:16.950
Yes, forgive me.
I couldn't hold them with my strength.

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:19.520
Even so, I need to walk them.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:23.730
All right.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.630
What's after the walk?

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:31.370
First is the basics of physical contact. Pat them.

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:33.240
Clarice, come here.

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:41.210
It's just a dog. They're dogs.

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:46.150
Oh, good boy.

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:05.330
Yoko, forgive me.

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:08.640
I never gave you much physical contact.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.580
I finally understood.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.750
Just how preferable you are.

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:23.180
When I get back, I'll give you all the physical contact you want.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:44.840
Oh, Clarice.

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:48.310
Hey.

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:49.780
Wait up.

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:53.550
Keita is still on it?

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:57.690
Yes, he is working hard.
He sure is great.

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:04.060
Come on, don't be scared.

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:11.300
It doesn't hurt.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.340
You're just afraid, right?

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:23.080
How magnificent.
He has natural talent.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.350
You mean, Keita is amazing?

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:28.180
Yes. He might seem rough,

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:30.820
but inside, he's full of love.

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:33.790
Such a wonderful Inukami User.

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:35.620
Is that so?

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.060
I see.

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:55.240
What's wrong?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:57.950
I don't understand as well.

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.380
One's missing.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:01.920
What?

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:04.990
The smallest one. The name is...

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:06.860
Stephanie.

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:15.430
Now you can no longer ruin our city.

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:20.900
If you want him released, then all of you leave the city!

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:29.910
Stephanie.

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:35.450
What have they done?

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.330
Andreanov.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:48.000
No, they've lost control with rage.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.600
Let's go, Yoko!

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:51.300
And do what?

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.070
We're going to stop them.

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:55.840
Okay.

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:13.920
Don't be scared.
Stop them here!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:20.130
Yoko, transport me with Teleport.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:23.430
What? If I do that, you'll...

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:25.170
It's all right, hurry up!

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:26.770
Keita.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:29.670
Teleport.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:58.430
Keita!

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:11.350
What is this?

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.520
The machos lost their anger.

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:20.090
That kid protected the machos.

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:24.390
He sacrificed himself to save our lives!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:28.700
Keita!

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:44.780
You guys.

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:57.790
Thank you, everyone.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:18.850
Such kindness and friendship.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:21.550
The machos are opening up their hearts!

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:24.320
Keita.

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:27.460
Thank you, everyone.

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.060
Thank you.

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:41.540
Now all the dog spirits possessing the students have rested in peace.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:44.110
The conflict with the city

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:48.280
has been resolved with the students helping reconstruction.

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:52.850
I see. No wonder Keita ended up like that.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:53.780
Indeed.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:00.820
Dogs!

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:04.130
Men are dogs!

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:07.030
Keita, bad dog.

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:10.000
I told you to stay quiet inside.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.000
Keita, are you alive?

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:22.780
Don't worry. I'll take responsibility and take care of you.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.510
Right, Keita?

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:43.100
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:48.470
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:53.510
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:58.580
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:01.950
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:04.520
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:07.160
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:10.560
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:13.630
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:16.300
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:21.570
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.010
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.010 --> 00:22:26.710
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:32.850
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.210 --> 00:22:35.520
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Let's fight</i>

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

